    {
      "title": "躯干 / Trunk",
      "text": {
        "zh": "原文先放轴承和M3插入件，再用2个M3x10连接上下躯干。",
        "en": "Source places bearings and M3 inserts, then joins trunk sections with two M3x10 screws."
      },
      "source": "https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini/blob/b23317a485b3cec7d8417f352478778b3475173c/docs/assembly_guide.md"
    },
    {
      "title": "脚部 / Feet",
      "text": {
        "zh": "TPU与PLA底板组合，用2个M3x6连接；注意电机驱动侧方向。",
        "en": "TPU and PLA sole sections join with two M3x6 screws; source specifies motor driver-side orientation."
      },
      "source": "https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini/blob/b23317a485b3cec7d8417f352478778b3475173c/docs/assembly_guide.md"
    },
    {
      "title": "小腿 / Shins",
      "text": {
        "zh": "leg_spacer两侧共4个M3插入件；先穿脚部电机线再装侧板。",
        "en": "Four M3 inserts across leg_spacer sides; route the foot motor cable before side assembly."
      },
      "source": "https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini/blob/b23317a485b3cec7d8417f352478778b3475173c/docs/assembly_guide.md"
    },
    {
      "title": "IMU与缺失章节 / IMU and gaps",
      "text": {
        "zh": "官方警告照片IMU倒置；头部/颈部和表情步骤不可凭空补齐。",
        "en": "Source warns that the IMU photo is upside down; missing head/neck/expression details must not be invented."
      },
      "source": "https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini/blob/b23317a485b3cec7d8417f352478778b3475173c/docs/assembly_guide.md"
    }
  ],
